t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fas fa-user-graduate\"><\/i>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPour l'\u00e9l\u00e8ve\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tgagner du temps, renforcer la confiance en soi et \u00e9viter les erreurs co\u00fbteuses.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2cbf6e2 elementor-position-inline-start elementor-view-default elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"2cbf6e2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fas fa-house-user\"><\/i>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPour les parents\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tinvestir sereinement dans l\u2019avenir des enfants et \u00e9viter les r\u00e9orientations ou abandons d\u2019\u00e9tudes.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a2a29b3 elementor-position-inline-start elementor-view-default elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"a2a29b3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fab fa-font-awesome-flag\"><\/i>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPour la soci\u00e9t\u00e9\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tformer des citoyens comp\u00e9tents, \u00e9panouis et pr\u00eats \u00e0 contribuer au d\u00e9veloppement de leur pays.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-41133fc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"41133fc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-618c4bf elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"618c4bf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Comment nous aidons les jeunes ?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab2a81c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ab2a81c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"536\" data-end=\"790\">S\u2019orienter apr\u00e8s le lyc\u00e9e ou pendant les \u00e9tudes sup\u00e9rieures n\u2019est pas toujours simple. Dans toute l\u2019Afrique de l\u2019Ouest, les jeunes et leurs parents se demandent : quelle formation choisir, quel m\u00e9tier pr\u00e9parer, o\u00f9 \u00e9tudier, comment financer les \u00e9tudes ?<\/p><p data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"937\">Le Grand Fr\u00e8re facilite l\u2019acc\u00e8s \u00e0 des informations fiables et met \u00e0 disposition des outils concrets pour r\u00e9pondre \u00e0 ces questions essentielles.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-452159c e-con-full e-grid e-con e-child\" data-id=\"452159c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a0f8452 elementor-position-inline-start elementor-view-default elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"a0f8452\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fas fa-school\"><\/i>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAnnuaire  \u00e9tablissements\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tUn r\u00e9pertoire actualis\u00e9 des universit\u00e9s, \u00e9coles et instituts d\u2019enseignement sup\u00e9rieur dans plusieurs pays de la sous-r\u00e9gion. Il permet de comparer les offres de formation et de choisir en toute confiance.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-69e1999 elementor-position-inline-start elementor-view-default elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"69e1999\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fas fa-video\"><\/i>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPartage d'exp\u00e9rience\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDes vid\u00e9os de partage d\u2019exp\u00e9rience pour vous donner un aper\u00e7u sur le cursus d\u2019un grand fr\u00e8re, un devancier et le quotidien de son m\u00e9tier.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0b22bc8 elementor-position-inline-start elementor-view-default elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"0b22bc8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fas fa-directions\"><\/i>\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tConseils orientation \t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDes contenus pratiques et adapt\u00e9s pour guider les \u00e9l\u00e8ves et \u00e9tudiants, comprendre les diff\u00e9rentes fili\u00e8res et d\u00e9velopper les comp\u00e9tences n\u00e9cessaires \u00e0 leur r\u00e9ussite.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-db1f4b1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"db1f4b1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-689871d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"689871d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Partenaires &amp; collaborateurs <\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dfdc4a3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"dfdc4a3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nous collaborons, travaillons et avons des relations de partenariat avec tous types de structures capables de nous accompagner \u00e0 r\u00e9aliser notre mission. Des structures d\u2019\u00e9ducation, d\u2019orientation aux structures dans le secteur du digital. Nous croyons que l\u2019\u00e9ducation, l\u2019orientation et la connaissance doivent\u00a0 \u00eatre d\u00e9centralis\u00e9es et accessibles \u00e0 tout moment.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c937fad e-grid e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c937fad\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8a88c4b elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"8a88c4b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"54\" src=\"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/logo_840x300-1-150x54.png\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-image-68309\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/logo_840x300-1-150x54.png 150w, https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/logo_840x300-1-300x107.png 300w, https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/logo_840x300-1-768x274.png 768w, https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/logo_840x300-1.png 840w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" \/><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\">Adage, agence web<\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Notre principal partenaire est une agence web sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e dans la conception de <a href=\"https:\/\/adage.africa\/\" style=\"font-weight:700\">solutions web de qualit\u00e9<\/a>. Nous \u00e9laborons ensemble les outils et fonctionnalit\u00e9s n\u00e9cessaires  pour le bonheur des \u00e9l\u00e8ves, des \u00e9tudiants, des \u00e9tablissements d\u2019enseignement et tous acteurs du monde de l\u2019\u00e9ducation. <a href=\"https:\/\/adage.africa\/contact\/\">Contactez Adage<\/a> sur adage.africa pour en savoir plus.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44060a3 elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"44060a3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><a href=\"https:\/\/lefaso.net\/\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"100\" src=\"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/LeFaso.net_-150x100.png\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-image-14926\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/LeFaso.net_-150x100.png 150w, https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/LeFaso.net_.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\"><a href=\"https:\/\/lefaso.net\/\">Le Faso.net<\/a><\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">Premier m\u00e9dia en ligne burkinab\u00e8, lefaso.net nous accompagne depuis maintenant deux saisons pour la diffusion des partages d\u2019exp\u00e9riences sur l\u2019orientation scolaire et professionnelle que Le Grand Fr\u00e8re produit. Acc\u00e9dez \u00e0 toutes les informations sur l\u2019actualit\u00e9 nationale et internationale partout dans le monde avec votre journal en ligne.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-be0a50e elementor-position-top elementor-widget elementor-widget-image-box\" data-id=\"be0a50e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-image-box-wrapper\"><figure class=\"elementor-image-box-img\"><a href=\"https:\/\/yiesafrica.net\/\" tabindex=\"-1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"73\" src=\"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/logo-Yies-Africa-e1769526456362-150x73.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-image-149088\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/logo-Yies-Africa-e1769526456362-150x73.jpg 150w, https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/logo-Yies-Africa-e1769526456362-300x146.jpg 300w, https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/logo-Yies-Africa-e1769526456362-768x372.jpg 768w, https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-content\/uploads\/logo-Yies-Africa-e1769526456362.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><div class=\"elementor-image-box-content\"><h3 class=\"elementor-image-box-title\"><a href=\"https:\/\/yiesafrica.net\/\">Yies Afirca<\/a><\/h3><p class=\"elementor-image-box-description\">YIES Africa accompagne depuis plusieurs ann\u00e9es les \u00e9tudiants dans leurs projets d\u2019\u00e9tudes \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9tranger. En partenariat avec Le Grand Fr\u00e8re, l\u2019organisation apporte son expertise sur la mobilit\u00e9 internationale, notamment les d\u00e9marches administratives, l\u2019acc\u00e8s au visa et l\u2019installation, afin de s\u00e9curiser chaque \u00e9tape du parcours \u00e9tudiant.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>A propos du Grand Fr\u00e8re Une initiative n\u00e9e d\u2019exp\u00e9riences personnelles pour guider les jeunes d\u2019Afrique de l\u2019Ouest dans leurs choix d\u2019\u00e9tudes et leur avenir professionnel. L\u2019histoire du Grand Fr\u00e8re En 2012, apr\u00e8s mon baccalaur\u00e9at, j\u2019ai \u00e9t\u00e9 confront\u00e9 \u00e0 un choix d\u00e9terminant pour mes \u00e9tudes universitaires. Mes parents me proposaient deux options : le marketing ou [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":3,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"","_seopress_titles_desc":"","_seopress_robots_index":"","_seopress_analysis_target_kw":"","footnotes":""},"localite":[],"class_list":["post-16113","page","type-page","status-publish","format-standard"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/16113","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.africa\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/legrandfrere.af